sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant UI as SplitOS UI
    participant RH as Runtime Host
    participant MS as Mode State
    participant MT as Mode Transition
    participant APP as App Lifecycle
    participant MP as Mode Policy
    participant CTX as Display/Audio/Input/Power
    participant PB as Privileged Broker
    participant WIN as Windows/Drivers
    participant GL as Game Launcher

    U->>UI: Switch to Game Mode
    UI->>RH: RequestOperationalMode(GAME)
    RH->>MS: Read committed mode
    MS-->>RH: WORK
    RH->>MT: Start transition WORK→GAME
    MT->>APP: Inspect Work context
    APP->>WIN: Read process/window/service evidence
    WIN-->>APP: Evidence

    alt User decision required
        MT-->>UI: Blocker details / AWAITING_USER
        U->>UI: Resolve or cancel
        alt Cancel
            UI->>MT: Cancel transition
            MT-->>MS: No commit
        else Continue
            UI->>MT: Continue
        end
    end

    MT->>MP: Resolve Game target policy
    MP->>CTX: Resolve target contexts
    MT->>CTX: Apply target context
    CTX->>WIN: User-session platform operations
    opt Privileged machine operation
        RH->>PB: Semantic privileged command
        PB->>WIN: Apply machine-level operation
        WIN-->>PB: Technical result
        PB-->>RH: Technical result
    end

    CTX->>WIN: Read actual state
    WIN-->>CTX: Actual evidence
    CTX-->>MT: Verification result

    alt Verification passed
        MT->>MS: Commit GAME
        MS-->>MT: GAME committed
        MT-->>GL: Game Mode ready
    else Verification failed
        MT->>CTX: Roll back / safe fallback
        CTX->>WIN: Restore safe target
        WIN-->>CTX: Actual evidence
        MT-->>MS: Keep WORK or escalate recovery
    end